'''Rathian''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the Event Capsule during the [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 207
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Rathian
|name2 = Rathian & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Rathian & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Rathian is all in all just a budget [[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Urs & Fenrir]]. Despite having a better cooldown by a good margin, her stats are worse than theirs and their [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|descendant]]'s, especially in range. Her [[Weaken|Weaken]], like Urs', is a nice bonus but nothing substantial or something [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] can't do. Generally, most midrangers such as [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] are far more useful, and [[Empire of Cats]] and early-game [[Legend Stages]] are the only places Rathian performs decently due to lack of alternative options.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Midranger}}

