==Trivia==
*In the main Monster Hunter games, Rathian is a Flying Wyvern monster, its poisonous tail club is one of its main attacks, and it is referred to as the Queen of the Land, which may possibly explain its range difference from its similar counterpart, [[Rathalos (Special Cat)|Rathalos]].
*Rathian's poisonous barbs are likely why they were given the Weaken ability in The Battle Cats, as Rathian was released before the conception of the Toxic ability.

